  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5401.15 “Transportation network company” shall mean “transportation network company” as defined in RSA 376-A:1, V, namely, “a corporation, partnership, sole proprietors",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5401.15 “Transportation network company” shall mean “transportation network company” as defined in RSA 376-A:1, V, namely, “a corporation, partnership, sole proprietorship, or other entity, that has a permit issued by the department and is operating in New Hampshire, that uses a digital network to connect transportation network company riders to transportation network company drivers who provide prearranged rides. A transportation network company shall not be deemed to control, direct, or manage the personal vehicles or transportation network company drivers that connect to its digital network, except where agreed to by written contract.”\n\nSource. #12491, eff 4-2-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5400.html"
}
